+&q6afedai {
+	/*
+	 * Tertiary MI2S RX is the path to the two AW88166 smart speaker
+	 * amplifiers on I2C9. The Android DTS routes them through MI2S2
+	 * (gpio133/134/135/137 = TERT MI2S sck/sd0/ws/sd1). We use both
+	 * data lines (sd0 and sd1) so each amp gets its own slot.
