+	/* Fan: pwm-fan driven by the pm8550 LPG PWM (channel 3, 50us),
+	 * powered through a fan_vdd(TLMM110)->fan_pwr(TLMM111) regulator chain,
+	 * tach feedback on TLMM67. Transcribed from the konkr stock fdt + modeled
+	 * on the working SM8650 Konkr (G3) fan node. CONFIG_SENSORS_PWM_FAN=m and
+	 * CONFIG_LEDS_QCOM_LPG=y are already enabled in the SM8750 config. */
